# Which model provider backs the app's Claude Code / agent sub-layer.
# Read by run.sh; override for one launch with  PROVIDER=anthropic ./run.sh
#
#   openai     -> route the agent through openai-proxy/proxy.mjs (Anthropic Messages API
#                 in, OpenAI out). Model and behaviour come from .openai-model.
#   anthropic  -> stock behaviour: the agent calls Anthropic directly with Claude, exactly
#                 as the shipped app does. The proxy is not started, and the OpenAI-only
#                 CLAUDE_CODE_* settings from .openai-model are NOT applied — sending an
#                 OpenAI model id (e.g. gpt-4.1-mini) to Anthropic just errors.
#
# Either way the main chat window is the remote claude.ai web app talking to Anthropic;
# this setting only affects the agent. The bundle patches are env-gated, so in anthropic
# mode they are inert and no files need reverting.
#
# Convenience wrappers: ./run-openai.sh and ./run-anthropic.sh force one mode.
PROVIDER=openai
